{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885740/extras/f1acd1e0ae1f722b7b338bfe791e90c0.avif?t=1754986886\" width=395 height=394 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The beetlefriends Magnus, Dagmar and Boris have invited you to  their house to play games together, and have great fun!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885740/extras/57cd9383ab9e957e30a57d41b8d2177e.avif?t=1754986886\" width=665 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you beat Magnus at his Memory game, guess the riddles from   Dagmar's riddle book, and solve the jig-saw puzzles Boris has for you?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885740/extras/be5f23454ac28f8935e28fd6b747e549.avif?t=1754986886\" width=591 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BeetleQuest: The Puzzle Game has:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully hand-drawn backgrounds</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jigsaw puzzles with picture from the BeetleQuest games</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A riddlebook with exciting language puzzles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A memory game with many characters from BeetleQuest 1 and 2!</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3885740?t=1754986886","background_raw":"https://store.akam